    "preview": "meta:\n  version: \"1.8.4\"\n  last_updated: \"2025-09-16\"\n  notes: >\n    v1.8.4 — Choices wired across all Alexandria apps:\n      - Expanded choices.json (planar_topologies, event/holiday/conflict tags, religions).\n      - alexandria-choices-prepare.ps1 derives 4 taxonomies: atlas, npc, bible, timeline.\n      - Worldseed/Timeline/Lore Bible/NPC Codex/Atlas scripts consume derived taxonomies.\n      - Atlas & new microapps (timeline/bible/codex) load lists directly from choices for choose/roll/custom UX.\n\nruntime:\n  workflows:\n    alexandria_choices: \".github/workflows/alexandria-choices.yml\"\n\nlessons_learned:\n  - \"Single source of truth (choices.json) eliminates drift; derive domain taxonomies for each app.\"\n  - \"PowerShell JSON writes capped at Depth 100 to avoid runner errors.\"\n  - \"Avoid inline type casts and parentheses-style calls in PS params; keep Linux-safe quoting.\"\n  - \"Provide folder scaffolds & graceful fallbacks to prevent 'No seed files found' blocking downstream jobs.\"\n"
