raditions, and strong clan loyalty.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Velari\",\n        \"traits\": \"Coastal merchants and sailors, adept in diplomacy and trade.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Arcanists of the Crystal Spire\","
