    "refs": [],
    "preview": "<!doctype html><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Carol — Preferences</title>\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui;background:#0b0f17;color:#e5e7eb;margin:0}header{padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #172033}main{padding:16px}input,textarea,button{background:#111827;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;color:#e5e7eb;padding:8px;margin:4px 0;width:100%}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}button{cursor:pointer}</style>\n<header><h1>Carol — Learning Preferences</h1></header>\n<main>\n  <p>Add likes/dislikes/avoidance notes. Click <b>Download feedback.json</b>, then upload it to <code>pages/apps/carol/profile/feedback.json</code> and re-run the plan workflow.</p>\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div><label>Likes (comma-separated)<textarea id=\"likes\" rows=\"6\">greek yogurt, cottage cheese, fruit cups, hummus, baked salmon</textarea></label></div>\n    <div><label>Dislikes (comma-separated)<textarea id=\"dislikes\" rows=\"6\">cilantro, cumin, raw onions</textarea></label></div>\n  </div>\n  <label>Extra Avoid List (comma-separated)<textarea id=\"avoid\" rows=\"3\">shellfish</textarea></label>\n  <label>Notes<textarea id=\"notes\" rows=\"3\"></textarea></label>\n  <button id=\"download\">Download feedback.json</button>\n</main>\n<script>\ndocument.getElementById('download').addEventListener('click', ()=>{\n  const payload = {\n    updated: new Date().toISOString(),\n    likes: document.getElementById('likes').value.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean),\n    dislikes: document.getElementById('dislikes').value.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean),\n    avoid: document.getElementById('avoid').value.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean),\n    notes: document.getElementById('notes').value.split('\\n').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean)\n  };\n  const a = document.createElement('a');\n  a.href = 'data:application/json;charset=utf-8,'+encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(payload,null,2));\n  a.download = 'feedback.json'; a.click();\n});\n</script>\n"
  },
