\n      </label>\n      <button id=\"save\">Save today’s log</button>\n      <p id=\"status\" class=\"mut\"></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section>\n      <h2>Today’s Cadence</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Morning</strong>: gentle warm‑up (neck, shoulders, hips).</li>\n        <li><strong>Midday</strong>: micro‑set (push‑ups + band pull‑aparts).</li>\n        <li><strong>Evening</strong>: unwind & stretch (spine, hamstrings, calves).</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"mut\">We’ll scale reps/sets after week‑1 based on your logs and Samsung Health imports.</p>\n    </section>"
