w walking and gentle knee bends\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"day\": \"Day 2\",\n      \"focus\": \"Low-impact cardiovascular and mobility\",\n      \"session\": [\n        \"Warm-up: 3 minutes slow walking\",\n        \"Cardio: 10 minutes low-impact stepping in place (knee height comfortable)\",\n        \"Mobility: Ankle pumps and circles (2 sets of 15 each)\",\n        \"Cool-down: 3 minutes slow walking and deep breathing\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"day\": \"Day 3\",\n      \"focus\": \"Strengthening and joint stability\",\n      \"session\": [\n        \"Warm-up: 3 minutes gentle marching\",\n        \"Strength: Side leg lifts with resistance band (2 sets of 10 reps per leg)\",\n        \"Strength: Seated calf raises (2 sets of 15 reps)\",\n        \"Mobility: Seated knee flexion and extension stretches (hold 20 seconds, 2 reps)\",\n        \"Cool-down: 3 minutes slow walking\""
