    "preview": "﻿{\n  \"title\": \"Cultivating Focus: A Gentle Journey\",\n  \"persona\": \"Supportive, calm, and encouraging guide\",\n  \"theme\": \"focus\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Welcome, Blanca. Let's begin by finding a comfortable position, sitting or lying down, where you can feel relaxed and supported. Gently close your eyes if that feels safe and comfortable for you.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Take a slow, deep breath in through your nose, filling your lungs fully. Hold it for a moment, then exhale gently through your mouth. Let your body soften with each breath.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Now, bring your attention to the natural rhythm of your breathing. Notice the cool air entering, the warm air leaving. There’s no need to change anything, just observe.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"As you continue to breathe calmly, imagine a soft light glowing gently at the center of your forehead, the space between your eyebrows. This light represents your focus, steady and calm.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"With each breath, see this light growing a little brighter, a little steadier. Feel it anchoring your attention, drawing you inward to a place of calm clarity.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"If your mind begins to wander, that’s okay. Gently guide your awareness back to the soft light and your breath, without judgment or frustration.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Now, picture yourself engaging in a task that requires your focus. See yourself calm, clear, and fully present, moving through each step with ease and confidence.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Notice how your breath supports your concentration, steady and unhurried. Allow this sense of focus to deepen with every inhale and exhale.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Remind yourself gently: I am capable of focusing. I allow myself to be present, one moment at a time.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Take a few more breaths here, feeling grounded and centered. Know that this calm focus is always within you, ready to be accessed whenever you need.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"Slowly begin to bring your awareness back to your surroundings. Wiggle your fingers and toes, feeling the surface beneath you.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"t_sec\": 30,\n      \"text\": \"When you feel ready, gently open your eyes, carrying this sense of calm focus with you into the rest of your day.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"safety_note\": \"This session is designed to promote relaxation and focus. If you feel any discomfort or dizziness, please pause and return to your normal state. Always practice in a safe environment.\"\n}"
  },
