    "preview": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tracy — Wallpapers</title>\n<style>body{background:#0b1220;color:#e6e9ff;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto;margin:0;padding:16px}a{color:#a5d6ff}input,button{font:inherit}figure{margin:0}</style></head>\n<body><h1>Tracy — Wallpapers</h1>\n<p>This tool helps pick or set a wallpaper URL and produces a <code>hero.css</code> you can upload to <code>/pages/apps/_city/hero.css</code>.</p>\n<p>Paste image URL (e.g. <code>/asset/textures/wallpapers/hero.jpg</code>):</p>\n<p><input id=\"u\" style=\"width:80%\" value=\"/asset/textures/wallpapers/hero.jpg\"> <button onclick=\"apply()\">Preview</button></p>\n<figure><img id=\"p\" alt=\"preview\" style=\"max-width:100%;border:1px solid #243553;border-radius:10px;display:none\"></figure>\n<p><button onclick=\"download()\">Download hero.css</button> · <a href=\"/pages/apps/_city/index.html\" style=\"color:#a5d6ff\">← City</a></p>\n<script>\nfunction apply(){const url=document.getElementById('u').value.trim(); const img=document.getElementById('p'); img.src=url; img.style.display='block';}\nfunction download(){const url=document.getElementById('u').value.trim(); const css=`:root{{--hero:url('${url}')}}`; const blob=new Blob([css],{type:'text/css'}); const a=document.createElement('a'); a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob); a.download='hero.css'; a.click();}\n</script></body></html>"
